{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And to his sons with him.</b> The speech of the Shekhinah came also to the sons; and lest you understand that the speech was to Noah alone, so that he would say this to his sons, therefore the word אתו was added, to explain that they too were included in the speech. And accordingly you will find the language of the passage that He speaks to them in plural language. And the intent is for the sake of ויפת (Japheth), for חם (Ham) is not worthy of this."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:11:23.930301764Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}